  "final_answer": "I have comprehensive information about bicycle parking near the Empire State Building. Let me provide a clear final answer now.\n\n## Bicycle Parking Near the Empire State Building\n\nI searched Google Maps (centered on the Empire State Building at 20 W 34th St, New York, NY 10001) and found the following bicycle parking options:\n\n### Dedicated Bicycle Parking (closest to Empire State Building):\n1. **iPark** — Bicycle parking lot at **70 W 38th St** (1 block north)\n   - ⭐ 2.3 (44 reviews) · Open until 00:00 · +1 212-764-1495\n\n2. **Bike Parking** — Bicycle rack at **104 W 38th St** (~1 block northwest)\n   - ⭐ 5.0 (1 review) · Wheelchair-accessible entrance\n\n3. **Parking Lot for Bicycles** — Bicycle parking lot\n   - ⭐ 4.0 (1 review)\n\n### Parking Garages with Bicycle Parking:\n4. **Centerpark East 38th Street Parking Garage** — **35 E 38th St** (a few blocks NE)\n   - ⭐ 3.4 (15 reviews) · 24 hours · +1 646-833-7922\n\n5. **Centerpark East 39th Street Parking Garage** — **36 E 39th St**\n   - ⭐ 2.8 (29 reviews) · 24 hours · +1 646-833-7922\n\n6. **Meyers Parking (MP Gotham Garage)** — **9 W 35th St** (right at the Empire State Building)\n   - ⭐ 3.2 (135 reviews) · 24 hours · +1 212-268-8572\n\n### Citi Bike Sharing Stations (closest):\n7. **Citi Bike: E 32 St & Park Ave** — 3.7 ⭐\n8. **Citi Bike: E 30 St & Park Ave S** — 5.0 ⭐\n9. **Citi Bike: Park Ave & E 42 St** — 3.3 ⭐\n\nThe **closest dedicated bicycle parking to the Empire State Building is iPark at 70 W 38th Street**, just one block north of the building's main entrance. For 24-hour access, the **Centerpark garages on East 38th/39th Streets** and **Meyers Parking on W 35th St** are the best options.",
